r put to death, forbidding all use of Ethermancy and other manipulation of the Ether.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Order's arrival in Kelaura marked the start of a war with the native tribes across the continent, the Sidaquisi, the Udenvatoi, the Kawadinage and other smaller tribes all fought against the Order until one day, their infamous Lord, Pate Yarlthon, disapeared, and the Order's power was weakened. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades later things are at a cold stand still between the Sidaquisi and the Scarlet Order, war is brewing back across the sea to the Order's homeland of Westervale, and corruption runs rampant amongst the Order's ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective Haerrison and his partner and wife, Detective Brock, investigate the murder of a local council member which leads to a derelict fortress swathed in cerebral nightmares of The Hat Man, and an encounter with a powerful woman with supernatural abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
